in="00:43.260" end="00:43.500">to </span><span begin="00:43.500" end="00:44.250">my </span><span begin="00:44.250" end="00:45.600">head</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.710" end="00:51.480"><span begin="00:46.710" end="00:47.250">Step </span><span begin="00:47.250" end="00:48.390">outside</span><span begin="00:48.390" end="00:48.390">, </span><span begin="00:48.390" end="00:49.740">summertime's </span><span begin="00:49.740" end="00:49.920">in </span><span begin="00:49.920" end="00:51.480">bloom</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.710" end="00:55.590"><span begin="00:52.710" end="00:53.130">Stand </span><span begin="00:53.130" end="00:53.370">up </span><span begin="00:53.370" end="00:53.940">beside </span><span begin="00:53.940" end="00:54.060">the </span><span begin="00:54.060" end="00:55.590">fireplace</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.620" end="00:58.500"><span begin="00:55.620" end="00:56.100">Take </span><span begin="00:56.100" end="00:56.430">that </span><span begin="00:56.430" end="00:56.760">look </span><span begin="00:56.760" end="00:57.120">from </span><span begin="00:57.120" end="00:57.390">off </span><span begin="00:57.390" end="00:57.570">your </span><span begin="00:57.570" end="00:58.500">face</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.530" end="01:06.510"><span begin="00:58.530" end="00:59.070">You </span><span begin="00:59.070" end="00:59.460">ain't </span><span begin="00:59.460" end="00:59.880">ever </span><span begin="00:59.880" end="01:00.630">gonna </span><span begin="01:00.630" end="01:01.020">burn </span><span begin="01:01.020" end="01:01.770">my </span><span begin="01:01.770" end="01:02.370">heart </span><span begin="01:02.370" end="01:06.510">out</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.990" end="01:20.580"><span begin="01:09.990" end="01:10.290">And </span><span begin="01:10.290" end="01:11.760">So </span><span begin="01:11.760" end="01:12.540">Sally </span><span begin="01:12.540" end="01:12.930">can </span><span begin="01: