><span begin="01:46.950" end="01:48.090">nobody </span><span begin="01:48.090" end="01:50.220">knows </span><span begin="01:50.220" end="01:50.550">if </span><span begin="01:50.550" end="01:50.700">it's </span><span begin="01:50.700" end="01:51.000">night </span><span begin="01:51.000" end="01:51.210">or </span><span begin="01:51.210" end="01:52.860">day</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.240" end="01:58.260"><span begin="01:54.240" end="01:54.720">Please </span><span begin="01:54.720" end="01:55.050">don't </span><span begin="01:55.050" end="01:55.470">put </span><span begin="01:55.470" end="01:55.770">your </span><span begin="01:55.770" end="01:56.280">life </span><span begin="01:56.280" end="01:56.550">in </span><span begin="01:56.550" end="01:56.850">the </span><span begin="01:56.850" end="01:58.260">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.320" end="02:01.740"><span begin="01:58.320" end="01:58.590">Of </span><span begin="01:58.590" end="01:58.680">a </span><span begin="01:58.680" end="01:59.190">Rock </span><span begin="01:59.190" end="01:59.310">n </span><span begin="01:59.310" end="01:59.760">Roll </span><span begin="01:59.760" end="02:01.740">band</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.770" end="02:04.440"><span begin="02:01.770" end="02:01.980">Who'll </span><span begin="02:01.980" end="02:02.280">throw </span><span begin="02:02.280" end="02:02.460">it </span><span begin="02:02.460" end="02:02.820">all </span><span begin="02:02.820" end="02:04.440">away</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.150" end="02:10.530"><span begin="02:06.150" end="02:06.330">I'll </span><span begin="02:06.330" end="02:06.690">gonna </span><span begin="02:06.690" end="02:07.080">start </span><span begin="02:07.080" end="02:07.140">a </span><span begin="02:07.140" end="02:08.040">revolution </span><span begin="02:08.040" end="02:08.460">from </span><span begin="02:08.460" end="02:09.090">my </span><span begin="02:09.090" end="02:10.530">bed</span></p><p ttm:agent="v